. with AUTHSERVER instance, as t","title":"InterSystems IRIS Open Authorization Framework (OAuth 2.0) implementation - part 2","url":"https://community.intersystems.com/printpdf/410391"},{"type":"text_result","domain":"datatracker.ietf.org","ref_id":"turn0search14","snippet":"Internet-Draft The OAuth 2.1 Authorization Framework March 2026 ... OAuth does not define any scope values, instead scopes are defined by","title":"Enscript Output","url":"https://datatracker.ietf.org/meeting/interim-2021-oauth-12/agenda/oauth-drafts.pdf"},{"type":"text_result","domain":"www.reddit.com","ref_id":"turn0reddit15","snippet":"\\* If you use Strava to sync data to intervals.icu you won't be able to see it in this app or any other app that","title":"Intervals.icu companion app for iPhone, Apple Watch, iPad and macOS. With widgets!","url":"https://www.reddit.com/r/Velo/comments/1j6lmw3/intervalsicu_companion_app_for_iphone_apple_watch/"},{"type":"text_result","domain":"www.microfocus.com","ref_id":"turn0search16","snippet":"The TokenInfo Endpoint is used for validating refresh tokens and access tokens issued in OAuth 2.0 Authorization flows. ... <tr><td>scope</td><td>Yes</td><td>list of scope values the token","title":"Access Manager 5.0 OAuth Application Developer Guide","url":"https://www.microfocus.com/documentation/access-manager/developer-documentation-5.1/pdfdoc/oauth-application-developer-guide/oauth-application-developer-guide.pdf"},{"type":"text_result","domain":"www.netiq.com","ref_id":"turn0search17","snippet":"<tr><td>scope</td><td>List of scopes the application requires. ... The API server will validate this access token and authorize the incoming API requests based on the scopes","title":"OAuth Application Developer Guide","url":"https://www.netiq.com/documentation/access-manager-44-developer-documentation/pdfdoc/oauth-application-developer-guide/oauth-application-developer-guide.pdf"}]}}
{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_7","type":"agent_message","text":"The provider’s OAuth guide says each scope family takes one level, and WRITE includes READ. The current URL asks for both READ and WRITE for ACTIVITY and CALENDAR. The guide also shows token responses without `expires_in` or `refresh_token`, matching Rivera’s log. I’m updating the scope list and treating a missing expiry as unspecified, then changing Connect to start OAuth through an authenticated API call."}}
